Secret Hitler adaptation — license notice
=============================================

The Secret Hitler game design, rules, and concepts implemented in this
folder are the work of Goat, Wolf, & Cabbage LLC
(Mike Boxleiter, Tommy Maranges, Max Temkin; art by Mackenzie Schubert).

Original: https://www.secrethitler.com

This adaptation is made under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt this folder's contents under these terms:
- Attribution: credit Goat, Wolf, & Cabbage, link back to
  secrethitler.com, and note your changes.
- Non-Commercial: no commercial use. This project makes no money.
- Share-Alike: distribute your version under this same license.

Per the creators' terms, nothing using their game may be submitted to any
app store. This project is web-only.

Code in this folder is original to this project.

Card art is NOT original: src/assets/policy-liberal.png and
src/assets/policy-fascist.png are derived from the official Secret Hitler
print-and-play PDF (https://www.secrethitler.com/assets/secret_hitler_print_and_play.pdf),
used under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Changes made to that art, as the license requires us to state:
- the Liberal and Fascist policy cards were cropped out of the print-and-play
  sheets, and the Fascist card was rotated upright;
- the surrounding page white was made transparent;
- the print ink was recoloured to this project's palette (liberal blue,
  later re-tinted to teal #0F95B0; fascist red, later re-tinted to orange
  #F26838).

Everything else in this folder's UI is original.
